            "wireless"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "許多公司已從有線網路改用無線網路，以降低佈線成本。"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "The airline offers in-flight wireless so passengers can stream movies on their devices.",
          "highlight": [
            "wireless"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "這家航空公司提供機上無線網路，讓乘客可以在自己的裝置上串流電影。"
